# KhetSe Stitch Design Lock

Visual source of truth is `_stitch_refs/` (`screen.png` + `DESIGN.md`). Do not invent a new look.

- Font: **Plus Jakarta Sans** (400–800) + Material Symbols Outlined
- Canvas: `#FFF8EE` (override Tailwind `surface` `#f0fdf0` on page backgrounds)
- Primary / leaf: `#006b31` (prose also uses `#2F8F4E` for brand marks)
- Primary container: `#238545`
- CTA / harvest orange: `#fe7443` / `#F06A3A` (`secondary-container`) — primary buttons only
- Deep rust secondary: `#a93707`
- Sun yellow / Kal Aayega: `#ffdf95` / `#F5C542`
- Ink text: `#131e16` / `#1F2A22`
- Cards: white, **20px** radius, `1px #F0E6D6`, warm umber shadow
- Buttons/chips/search: **pill** `9999px`; CTA min-height 48px
- Mobile gutters 16px; desktop max-width **1080px**; catalog 2-col mobile, 3–4 col desktop
- Bottom nav on customer mobile; do not stretch mobile layout to desktop

Before any UI page: open the matching `_stitch_refs/**/screen.png` and match spacing, type, color, radius, icons. Stitch `code.html` is a visual reference only — never ship it as a route. No mock screenshot data (no hardcoded KS-104 / tomato prices as production truth).
